1
00:00:35,150 --> 00:00:35,990
Boss,

2
00:00:36,020 --> 00:00:36,940
how did it go?

3
00:00:38,260 --> 00:00:39,060
It's fine now.

4
00:00:39,850 --> 00:00:41,570
Lu Ye is still too green

5
00:00:41,710 --> 00:00:42,910
and acts on impulse.

6
00:00:43,030 --> 00:00:44,960
He just killed Qinglong outright.

7
00:00:45,820 --> 00:00:46,750
But,

8
00:00:47,250 --> 00:00:49,180
who told him to pocket those goods?

9
00:00:49,230 --> 00:00:51,510
He deserves to be the fall guy.

10
00:00:54,740 --> 00:00:56,020
Are the tickets ready?

11
00:01:01,240 --> 00:01:03,400
Remember to be careful.

12
00:01:03,700 --> 00:01:05,630
Don't let the Shisha Gang find you.

13
00:01:06,590 --> 00:01:07,510
Yes.

14
00:01:07,830 --> 00:01:08,590
Boss,

15
00:01:08,740 --> 00:01:11,940
the Shisha Gang hasn't transferred
the last payment yet.

16
00:01:13,880 --> 00:01:14,960
Three days.

17
00:01:15,410 --> 00:01:17,289
I'll wait for them for three days at most.

18
00:01:17,289 --> 00:01:18,330
Otherwise,

19
00:01:18,910 --> 00:01:21,950
even if I die, I'll drag them down
with me.

20
00:01:22,430 --> 00:01:25,100
[Eclipse in the Lost City; Episode 6]

21
00:01:35,830 --> 00:01:36,950
Young Master,

22
00:01:37,479 --> 00:01:38,720
why are you here?

23
00:01:41,060 --> 00:01:42,460
You've wiped it so clean.

24
00:01:42,509 --> 00:01:44,460
I see you haven’t forgotten the old man.

25
00:01:44,460 --> 00:01:46,300
The old chief's kindness,

26
00:01:46,320 --> 00:01:48,520
I will never forget it in this life.

27
00:01:51,009 --> 00:01:52,690
Then why did you kill him?

28
00:01:55,020 --> 00:01:56,860
Young Master, what do you mean?

29
00:01:56,880 --> 00:01:59,890
Wasn't it Qinglong
who killed the old chief?

30
00:02:08,680 --> 00:02:09,960
He stole the goods,

31
00:02:10,800 --> 00:02:12,130
but didn't kill anyone.

32
00:02:12,630 --> 00:02:14,540
At most, he kicked him when he was down.

33
00:02:14,540 --> 00:02:15,200
But you...

34
00:02:17,160 --> 00:02:19,690
are the one who truly bit the hand
that fed you.

35
00:02:19,870 --> 00:02:21,190
How did you know?

36
00:02:21,770 --> 00:02:22,970
You said it yourself.

37
00:02:23,170 --> 00:02:23,770
What?

38
00:02:25,329 --> 00:02:27,540
You were so eager to make Qinglong
the scapegoat,

39
00:02:27,540 --> 00:02:28,940
you constantly hint to me

40
00:02:29,290 --> 00:02:31,380
that he was the one who poisoned
the old chief.

41
00:02:31,380 --> 00:02:34,900
He saved your life with a silver needle
back then,

42
00:02:35,020 --> 00:02:36,940
yet you bit the hand that fed you.

43
00:02:37,160 --> 00:02:40,040
You've been by the old chief's side
for so many years.

44
00:02:40,040 --> 00:02:42,470
I’m afraid you’ve had ulterior motives
all along.

45
00:02:42,470 --> 00:02:43,670
But in the entire Qingtian Gang,

46
00:02:43,670 --> 00:02:45,200
besides Uncle Zhong and me,

47
00:02:45,410 --> 00:02:47,860
no one knew the true cause
of the old chief's death.

48
00:02:47,860 --> 00:02:48,680
Except

49
00:02:49,920 --> 00:02:50,920
the murderer.

50
00:02:51,329 --> 00:02:53,190
Since you saw through it long ago,

51
00:02:53,260 --> 00:02:54,730
why did you still kill Qinglong?

52
00:02:54,730 --> 00:02:55,250
You...

53
00:02:59,670 --> 00:03:01,660
You've wanted to kill him for a long time

54
00:03:01,660 --> 00:03:03,060
to take his territory.

55
00:03:03,460 --> 00:03:05,260
You just needed an excuse.

56
00:03:05,530 --> 00:03:06,490
That wasn't his.

57
00:03:07,580 --> 00:03:10,260
I'm just taking back
what belongs to the Qingtian Gang.

58
00:03:10,260 --> 00:03:12,700
So you deliberately made me lower my guard

59
00:03:12,730 --> 00:03:14,290
to trap me.

60
00:03:14,560 --> 00:03:15,360
Young Master,

61
00:03:15,620 --> 00:03:16,740
you've grown up.

62
00:03:17,440 --> 00:03:19,120
I really underestimated you.

63
00:03:19,490 --> 00:03:20,290
Aunt Que.

64
00:03:22,620 --> 00:03:24,079
I underestimated you too.

65
00:03:26,110 --> 00:03:27,770
The old chief gave this to you.

66
00:03:28,250 --> 00:03:29,579
Back then, your family fell into ruin,

67
00:03:29,579 --> 00:03:31,000
and you were wandering alone.

68
00:03:31,000 --> 00:03:32,860
The old chief saw your intelligence

69
00:03:32,860 --> 00:03:34,660
and let you manage the accounts.

70
00:03:34,890 --> 00:03:36,820
But despite all his calculations,

71
00:03:37,370 --> 00:03:39,570
he didn't expect to die by your hands.

72
00:03:42,480 --> 00:03:45,040
The old chief was kind to me.

73
00:03:46,100 --> 00:03:48,300
But did he ever consider my situation?

74
00:03:48,550 --> 00:03:49,940
He kept talking about rules

75
00:03:49,940 --> 00:03:51,740
and wouldn't let me touch opium.

76
00:03:52,270 --> 00:03:55,130
But ordinary businesses would never
fall to women.

77
00:03:55,260 --> 00:03:56,560
If a woman wants to make money,

78
00:03:56,560 --> 00:03:58,320
she has to risk her life.

79
00:03:58,460 --> 00:03:59,460
His refusal

80
00:03:59,480 --> 00:04:00,760
was standing in my way.

81
00:04:03,760 --> 00:04:05,290
Working for the Shisha Gang

82
00:04:05,710 --> 00:04:07,510
at least brings in a lot of cash

83
00:04:07,810 --> 00:04:09,530
and a special license.

84
00:04:09,930 --> 00:04:13,490
These are things the old chief
couldn't give me.

85
00:04:14,020 --> 00:04:15,100
With it,

86
00:04:15,120 --> 00:04:17,160
I can do the opium business.

87
00:04:17,370 --> 00:04:18,700
Even if I change places,

88
00:04:18,709 --> 00:04:20,370
I can still establish myself.

89
00:04:25,390 --> 00:04:26,190
Aunt Que.

90
00:04:27,350 --> 00:04:31,110
Do you really think the Shisha Gang
will let you go?

91
00:04:33,190 --> 00:04:34,510
I have another way.

92
00:04:35,240 --> 00:04:36,440
Do you want to take it?

93
00:05:00,670 --> 00:05:02,400
She's going to escape by train.

94
00:05:12,630 --> 00:05:13,750
Cooperate with me.

95
00:05:14,110 --> 00:05:15,240
I'll keep you alive.

96
00:05:15,350 --> 00:05:16,870
Why should I trust you?

97
00:05:18,350 --> 00:05:19,710
As far as I know,

98
00:05:19,790 --> 00:05:22,430
the Shisha Gang has always been
hunting down informants.

99
00:05:22,430 --> 00:05:23,750
With their methods,

100
00:05:23,780 --> 00:05:26,420
it's only a matter of time
before they find you.

101
00:05:26,830 --> 00:05:28,710
Trust me or the Shisha Gang.

102
00:05:28,910 --> 00:05:29,910
It's your choice.

103
00:05:32,550 --> 00:05:33,880
What do you want to know?

104
00:05:34,550 --> 00:05:35,430
The truth.

105
00:05:35,950 --> 00:05:38,070
How did you mix the drugs into the goods

106
00:05:38,070 --> 00:05:39,690
and frame my father for it?

107
00:05:43,710 --> 00:05:44,510
Frame?

108
00:05:45,350 --> 00:05:46,880
What a frame-up.

109
00:05:47,270 --> 00:05:48,070
Young Master,

110
00:05:48,790 --> 00:05:50,750
have you ever considered the possibility

111
00:05:50,750 --> 00:05:52,210
that it wasn't a frame-up,

112
00:05:52,270 --> 00:05:53,670
but the truth?

113
00:05:54,990 --> 00:05:55,950
From the very beginning,

114
00:05:55,950 --> 00:05:58,190
the old chief knew clearly

115
00:05:58,190 --> 00:06:00,650
that there were drugs
in that batch of goods.

116
00:06:04,230 --> 00:06:05,030
What?

117
00:06:05,470 --> 00:06:06,600
That's impossible.

118
00:06:06,640 --> 00:06:10,600
I can only tell you that this matter
is related to the Shisha Gang.

119
00:06:12,110 --> 00:06:13,830
But I'm only responsible for killing.

120
00:06:13,830 --> 00:06:15,550
I don't know anything else.

121
00:06:15,790 --> 00:06:18,950
If you want to know the truth,
you can only ask them.

122
00:06:20,910 --> 00:06:22,310
I can cooperate with you.

123
00:06:22,880 --> 00:06:24,440
But after it's done,

124
00:06:26,150 --> 00:06:27,550
I still want this amount.

125
00:06:29,070 --> 00:06:30,400
What are you going to do?

126
00:06:32,909 --> 00:06:35,390
The person from the Shisha Gang
responsible for hunting me down

127
00:06:35,390 --> 00:06:36,990
might know the inside story.

128
00:06:37,790 --> 00:06:39,870
I have a way to help you lure him out.

129
00:06:40,990 --> 00:06:44,270
As for whether you can make him talk,

130
00:06:46,870 --> 00:06:48,550
that depends on your skills.

131
00:06:54,909 --> 00:06:55,710
Deal.

132
00:07:01,270 --> 00:07:03,310
Young Master, are you just
going to let her go?

133
00:07:03,310 --> 00:07:05,630
The law of the jungle prevails
in this world.

134
00:07:05,630 --> 00:07:07,960
It's not wrong for a woman
to be ambitious.

135
00:07:07,960 --> 00:07:10,360
Her mistake was trusting the wrong person.

136
00:07:17,940 --> 00:07:18,740
He's here.

137
00:07:30,550 --> 00:07:31,480
It's not Zhuque.

138
00:07:31,950 --> 00:07:33,080
We've been tricked.

139
00:07:35,659 --> 00:07:36,460
Don't move.

140
00:07:38,940 --> 00:07:40,180
It really is you.

141
00:07:41,350 --> 00:07:42,280
Where is Zhuque?

142
00:07:43,270 --> 00:07:45,130
She already took a train and left.

143
00:07:46,710 --> 00:07:49,360
Mr. Lu, you are truly kind-hearted.

144
00:07:49,380 --> 00:07:51,580
You even let your father's murderer go.

145
00:07:56,500 --> 00:07:59,300
So tell me, should I let you go?

146
00:08:03,350 --> 00:08:04,150
Shen Tianbai.

147
00:08:04,340 --> 00:08:06,620
How much do you actually know
about my father?

148
00:08:06,620 --> 00:08:08,820
And why on earth are you faking amnesia?

149
00:08:10,950 --> 00:08:12,170
It has nothing to do with you.

150
00:08:12,170 --> 00:08:12,970
Good.

151
00:08:13,870 --> 00:08:14,710
Very good.

152
00:08:14,830 --> 00:08:16,190
The game is over.

153
00:08:17,110 --> 00:08:17,830
Is it?

154
00:08:33,640 --> 00:08:34,440
You...

155
00:08:35,309 --> 00:08:36,510
You know me very well,

156
00:08:36,980 --> 00:08:38,100
but you forgot

157
00:08:38,390 --> 00:08:39,990
that I know you very well too.

158
00:08:42,100 --> 00:08:44,300
Important things should be kept close.

159
00:08:44,500 --> 00:08:45,740
You told me that.

160
00:08:48,670 --> 00:08:51,510
Breaking!

161
00:08:51,690 --> 00:08:53,450
The latest news in Ningcheng!

162
00:08:53,560 --> 00:08:55,380
Breaking!

163
00:08:55,470 --> 00:08:56,700
Latest news in Ningcheng!

164
00:08:56,700 --> 00:08:57,940
Come and see!

165
00:08:58,270 --> 00:08:59,790
Breaking! Breaking!

166
00:08:59,820 --> 00:09:01,020
Come and see!

167
00:09:01,040 --> 00:09:02,640
Latest news in Ningcheng!

168
00:09:03,520 --> 00:09:05,450
Shouldn't such an important thing

169
00:09:08,390 --> 00:09:09,670
be kept close to you?

170
00:09:12,720 --> 00:09:13,720
Give it back to me.

171
00:09:13,950 --> 00:09:15,070
What if I say no?

172
00:09:18,780 --> 00:09:19,700
Who cares?

173
00:09:21,190 --> 00:09:23,510
With someone as careless as you
becoming a police officer,

174
00:09:23,510 --> 00:09:25,530
I really worry about the future
of Ningcheng.

175
00:09:25,530 --> 00:09:27,250
If someone like you can study abroad,

176
00:09:27,250 --> 00:09:28,650
what else is impossible?

177
00:09:29,630 --> 00:09:31,690
We really have nothing to talk about.

178
00:09:31,990 --> 00:09:33,050
Glad we graduated.

179
00:09:34,600 --> 00:09:35,300
Lu Ye.

180
00:09:37,270 --> 00:09:39,070
Aren't you going to say goodbye?

181
00:09:39,880 --> 00:09:40,880
Did you forget?

182
00:09:41,550 --> 00:09:43,210
We have never even said hello.

183
00:09:43,570 --> 00:09:46,770
Those who haven't said hello
have no right to say goodbye.

184
00:10:18,390 --> 00:10:19,190
Alright.

185
00:10:19,910 --> 00:10:20,550
Go!

186
00:10:24,930 --> 00:10:26,610
Nice shooting.

187
00:10:32,830 --> 00:10:34,430
As expected of Officer Shen.

188
00:10:34,470 --> 00:10:37,800
You solved the Shisha Gang's big problem
with just one move.

189
00:10:37,950 --> 00:10:41,270
The boss will definitely like this gift.

190
00:10:44,390 --> 00:10:45,190
Young Master Lu,

191
00:10:45,190 --> 00:10:47,750
the chief asked me to bring you a message.

192
00:10:48,090 --> 00:10:49,850
You must get some rest

193
00:10:49,870 --> 00:10:51,600
and take good care of yourself.

194
00:10:51,870 --> 00:10:54,470
After all, the pain of losing a father

195
00:10:54,950 --> 00:10:56,830
is heartbreaking.

196
00:10:57,290 --> 00:10:58,090
Don't move.

197
00:11:02,430 --> 00:11:03,230
Thank you.

198
00:11:04,460 --> 00:11:05,590
I'll remember that.

199
00:11:08,550 --> 00:11:09,670
Officer Shen,

200
00:11:10,230 --> 00:11:10,990
please.

201
00:11:18,380 --> 00:11:19,660
The rest of the way,

202
00:11:20,510 --> 00:11:22,150
I must walk alone.

203
00:11:37,140 --> 00:11:38,200
This round,

204
00:11:38,800 --> 00:11:39,980
you won.
